=== REASONING ===
- Standard (2x2): three metric cards (optimal start hour, target SOC, savings/mo) + schedule match badge + WidgetTipCards for recommendations
- Wide (2x4+): adds 24h timeline bar showing peak (red) vs off-peak (green) hours with schedule marker
- Compact (1 col): centered display with start hour, SOC, savings badge
- Map recommendations -> TipItem[] with priority -> impact mapping
- No unit conversions needed (cost is currency, SOC is %, hours are time — none are distance/temp/pressure)
- All strings via useTranslation('dashboard')
- Null-safe: all data fields use ?? operator
- Touch targets: min-h-[44px] on interactive cards

